        {
          "quote": "Remember Tester, it’s your job to find any \"bugs\" in my program. A bug is when my program isn’t doing what was expected. Your job is to draw a line under the piece of code where you notice the instructions seem to be going wrong. You can stop the Bot at the point that you think there is a bug.",
